---
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro';
import '@/styles/services.css';
---

<Base
  title="Services"
  description="Product and technical consulting, software redesign, AI product advice, and custom websites, apps, and platforms. Work directly with Willie Chalmers."
>
  <div class="hx-shell hx-services-page" id="hx-services-page">
    <header class="hx-services-opening">
      <div>
        <h1>Services</h1><p>
          I can help you decide what to change, redesign your software, or build something new.
        </p>
      </div>
      <figure class="hx-interface-study" aria-hidden="true">
        <pre
          aria-hidden="true">       ┌─────────────────────────┐
       │ <span class="hx-study-warm">●</span> <span class="hx-study-warm">●</span> <span class="hx-study-warm">●</span>                   │
       ├─────────────────────────┤
       │                         │
       │  <span class="hx-study-blue">┌─────┐</span>  ───────────   │
       │  <span class="hx-study-blue">│     │</span>  ───────       │
       │  <span class="hx-study-blue">└─────┘</span>                │
       │                         │
       │  ───────────────────    │
       │  ─────────────          │
       │                         │
       └──────────────┬──────────┘
                      │
             <span class="hx-study-blue">┌────────┴────────┐
             │ &lt;main&gt;          │
             │   &lt;h1&gt;…&lt;/h1&gt;    │
             │ &lt;/main&gt;         │
             └─────────────────┘</span>
</pre>
      </figure>
    </header>
    <section class="hx-consulting-detail" aria-labelledby="service-consulting">
      <div class="hx-consulting-copy flow">
        <h2 id="service-consulting">Product &amp; technical consulting</h2>
        <p>
          You might have a product that needs improving, a technical decision to make, or an idea
          you’re not sure how to build. I can help you look at the options and decide what to do
          next.
        </p>
        <p>
          We’ll work out a recommendation and the reasons behind it. You can take that back to your
          team, or I can help with the design and development.
        </p>
        <a class="hx-service-action" href="/work-together/?need=consult"
          >Talk through a decision <span class="hx-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a
        >
      </div>
      <aside class="hx-consulting-questions">
        <h3>Some questions we can work through</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>What should we change about the product?</li><li>What should we build first?</li><li>
            Can we improve what we have, or do we need to rebuild it?
          </li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
    </section>
    <div class="hx-consulting-specialties">
      <section class="flow" aria-labelledby="service-redesign">
        <h2 id="service-redesign">Software redesign</h2>
        <p>
          Your software might have grown harder to use as you’ve added features. Or it might need to
          work for a different audience.
        </p>
        <p>
          I can review how people use it, identify where they get stuck, and redesign the parts that
          need attention. I’ll work through the technical constraints with you so the design can be
          built.
        </p>
        <a class="hx-service-action" href="/work-together/?need=redesign"
          >Discuss a redesign <span class="hx-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a
        >
      </section>
      <section class="flow" aria-labelledby="service-ai">
        <h2 id="service-ai">AI in your product</h2>
        <p>
          You might want to rethink your software around AI, or find out whether it would help at
          all.
        </p>
        <p>
          I can help you choose a useful application, design how people interact with it, and plan
          what happens when it makes a mistake. We can test the idea before changing the whole
          product.
        </p>
        <a class="hx-service-action" href="/work-together/?need=ai"
          >Work out where AI fits <span class="hx-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a
        >
      </section>
    </div>
    <section class="hx-development-detail" aria-labelledby="service-build">
      <h2 id="service-build">Websites, apps<br /> &amp; platforms</h2>
      <div class="flow">
        <p>
          I can design and build a website, app, or platform for your business. That includes
          working out what it needs to do, designing how people use it, and writing the software.
        </p><p>
          I can also work with your team if you need help with a particular part of the project.
          We’ll agree on the work before we start.
        </p><a class="hx-service-action" href="/work-together/?need=build"
          >Discuss something to build <span class="hx-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a
        >
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="hx-service-next flow" aria-labelledby="hx-service-next-title">
      <h2 id="hx-service-next-title">Tell me what you’re working on.</h2><p>
        Email me at <a href="mailto:hello@hypertext.studio">hello@hypertext.studio</a>.
      </p><p>
        If you’re not sure how I can help, <a href="/work-together/?need=unsure">start here</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
    <aside class="hx-note">
      <h2>Nonprofits &amp; social causes</h2><p>
        If you’re working for a nonprofit, a community project, or a social cause, <a
          href="/work-together/?nonprofit=1">ask about reduced rates</a
        >. Tell me who the work helps and what you need.
      </p>
    </aside>
  </div>
</Base>
